<title>USA: Mattel Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Mattel Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>LOS ANGELES, Feb 5 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.41		    $0.40</p>
<p> Net			113,456		  112,022</p>
<p> Revs		   1,190,545		1,155,284</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     275,184		  280,916</p>
<p>	  Year</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.36		    $1.26</p>
<p> Net			377,641		  357,802</p>
<p> Revs		   3,785,958		3,638,812</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     278,385		  281,015</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest fourth quarter and full year results include a nonrecurring charge of $21,810,000 related to the accounting for certain royalties and participation fees in prior periods.</p>
</text>
